    "status": "present",
    "value": "Orders arrive one after another, each with a price, a quantity and a side (buy or sell). Treat them as limit orders against an order book. A new buy order trades with resting sell orders whose price is at or below its price, cheapest first; a new sell trades with resting buy orders priced at or above its price, highest first. Trades can partially fill either side. Whatever quantity of the new order is left after matching rests in the book. Return the total number of shares traded across all orders."
  },
